 the  audience will jump off a cliff with you  comedians are often afraid to go to  those dark places and in this movie  sometimes you just want the characters  in love and thunder to scream louder  than the goats do or better yet ask why  the goats are screaming because as  someone living in 2022 i can relate with  someone who only communicates with  existential dread all that said taiko tt  clearly does not need my stupid improv  notes i love this film both as a marvel  nerd and as someone who just loves  heartfelt action movies and nudity aside  this is a family film you will be  shocked at how much of a family movie  love and thunder is i'm not gonna give  this any numerical score other than zero  out of ten mephisto's which is how i  have ranked every marvel title but  technically he might have shown up in  omnipotent city i didn't really see him  but then again you never see him you  just feel him inside you phrasing  intentional i cannot wait to hear what  you think about thor love and thunder  we're gonna have lots of videos coming  out this week about it so be sure to  subscribe to new rockstars you can also  follow new rocks on social media you can  follow me on social media on instagram  and twitter avos and again subscribe to  this channel for more announcements of  everything you love thanks for watching  bye  [Music]  you

